{"id":"a9ff8bb34acb4c57","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-k4-characteristic.md","title":"K4 Characteristic Frames","display":"prop-k4-characteristic — K4 Characteristic Frames","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-k4-characteristic","aliases":["89-prop-k4-characteristic"],"display":"prop-k4-characteristic — K4 Characteristic Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-k4-characteristic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-k4-characteristic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-k4-characteristic — K4 Characteristic Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(W,R)\\)</span> is a Kripke frame.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> is the transitivity predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}k4\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{K4}\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}k4\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{K4}\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> : K4逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> : 传递框架 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a>)</li>\n<li>K4相对于传递框架完备</li>\n<li>模态逻辑语义的基础结果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-